---
description: Decide field-level findings for maintainContinuity.
args: { goal: string; slice: EvidenceSlice }
returns: DecisionAtom[]
---
Apply this domain algorithm to the prepared slice: Review long-term consistency and introduce events that develop existing tensions or obligations. Check that new events are possible from current state, respect participant boundaries, and preserve stable checkpoints for replay, moderation, and recovery. For each consequential field return a value and evidence IDs, mark established, disputed, unknown, or inapplicable, and name a plausible alternative. Do not turn missing evidence into a negative fact or treat repeated volume as independent support unless the domain rule says so.
